{"t": "event", "kind": "card", "tMs": 32, "route": "blank", "title": "Every computer you own, one team of agents."}
{"t": "event", "kind": "navigate", "tMs": 2819, "route": "/settings/devices", "status": 200}
{"t": "event", "kind": "speech", "tMs": 5622, "route": "/settings/devices", "role": "caption", "text": "Devices: each computer joined with a single-use code bound to its key, and your passkey admitted it."}
{"t": "event", "kind": "speech", "tMs": 8765, "route": "/settings/devices", "role": "caption", "text": "vm-01 waits for your confirmation; laptop-02 was revoked. Nothing runs on either."}
{"t": "event", "kind": "click", "tMs": 13545, "route": "/settings/devices", "selector": "rig-01", "componentText": "rig-01", "redacted": false, "bbox": {"x": 288, "y": 203, "width": 29.09375, "height": 15}, "frame": "001.jpg"}
{"t": "event", "kind": "speech", "tMs": 14797, "route": "/settings/devices/:id", "role": "caption", "text": "rig-01's record. Enrolment grants nothing: until you grant it work, it runs nothing."}
{"t": "event", "kind": "speech", "tMs": 17074, "route": "/settings/devices/:id", "role": "caption", "text": "Grant it work per project: which harnesses, which tiers, which projects, which folders."}
